Services that include monthly free amounts for 12 months

For 12 months after signup, new customers can use up to the specified monthly free amount of each of these services without getting charged. **Service usage is billed at the pay-as-you-go rate after you reach the monthly limit.** [To learn more, see the Azure free account FAQ](https://azure.microsoft.com/free/free-account-faq/)

